  "releaseNotes": "* ValorantNet ReWrite \n   - This should fix a bunch of edge cases using custom requests, as well as internal\n   - This includes Optimizations, and a bunch of fixes\n   - Nothing should break from this, but as always report issues (I did testing)\n* Improved reliability of GameVersionService\n   - For non-devs this should fix a ton of issues where it returns the wrong versioning, as well as fallsback to Valorant-API.com\n* Improved usage for ValorantSocket\n   - Not sure why I made it so horribly to begin with, you now only need to provide the Initiator",
